Respawn reset

This is an explicit gameplay requirement:

Every respawn restores all three shield bars completely.

When the player’s existing G.dead countdown finishes:

* set shield back to 6
* restore the existing respawn invulnerability
* preserve the current respawn effect/audio behavior

When a rival/local-human R.dead countdown finishes:

* set that racer’s shield back to 6
* preserve the existing R.invuln = INVULNERABLE_TIME behavior

This must happen for every kind of wreck, not only wrecks caused by shield depletion.

Examples:

* six puddle/tumbleweed hits → shield reaches zero → wreck → respawn → 6/6
* meteor wreck while shield was 4/6 → respawn → 6/6
* another racer wrecks you while shield was 1/6 → respawn → 6/6

The reset belongs to respawn, not specifically to the shield-destruction branch.

During the wreck delay, do not prematurely refill it. The refill should correspond to the actual respawn event.

